model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "Upstream sync evidence binds an exact repository commit, validated carry bytes and whole-filename order. Strict replay stops at the first failed carry and retains its failure and unattempted suffix before removing disposable source state. Replay never resets its input checkout or treats a diagnostic conflict resolution as a complete candidate. A new-pin retirement preserves the old-pin rollback carry and archives its patch and registry bytes and digests. Retirement requires exact-prefix equivalence and final affected runtime scenarios; any observed difference restores the carry. Dashboard batch profiling switches only the prepared middleware layer and restores its exact bytes after failure. The profiler does not depend on a retired carry file and refuses to overwrite source changed during the measurement."
    }
  }
}
